{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果面向下一代Siri打造的人工智能升級計劃再次出現延遲。最新消息顯示，原本被寄予厚望的「應用深度控制」能力將不會在短期內到來，用户可能需要等到2027年春季才能體驗到這項關鍵功能。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585512.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.570786+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T15:34:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"4558a6a0f20ad8b55a42053057496db59fa8049f060cad4b8d2c3f28307e6e16","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}